    {"line_index": 21, "role": "latin", "block": "citation", "text": "S. Auguſt. lib. 1. c. 3. de ſerm. Do. in monte."},
    {"line_index": 22, "role": "latin", "block": "quotation", "text": "Paupertate ſpiritus peruenitur ad Scripturarū cognitionem : vbi opor-", "line_end_hyphen": true},
    {"line_index": 23, "role": "latin", "block": "quotation", "text": "tet hominem ſe mitem præbere, ne peruicacibus concertationibus indoci-", "line_end_hyphen": true},
    {"line_index": 24, "role": "latin", "block": "quotation", "text": "lis reddatur."},
    {"line_index": 25, "role": "translation", "regime": "italic-apparatus (vv, long-ſ)", "text": "Vve come to the vnderſtanding of Scriptures through pouertie of ſpirit : vvhere"},
